WEBVTT

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:31.421
Billa Gatesa i Warrena Buffetta,

00:01:31.421 --> 00:01:34.370
te je otkrio kako je
bilo ekvivalentno bogatstvu

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:39.123
donjih 40% populacije SAD,

00:01:39.123 --> 00:01:41.965
120 milijuna ljudi.

00:01:41.965 --> 00:01:44.329
Sad, kako to biva,

00:01:44.329 --> 00:01:47.133
Warren Buffett nije samo plutokrat,

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:50.860
već je i jedan od najoštroumnijih
promatrača tog fenomena,

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:54.162
i ima svoj omiljen broj.

00:01:54.162 --> 00:01:58.105
Buffett voli istaknuti
kako je u 1992.

00:01:58.105 --> 00:02:00.267
kombinirano bogatstvo ljudi